<title>USA: De Rigo SpA 96 FY shr per ADS falls.</title>
<headline>De Rigo SpA 96 FY shr per ADS falls.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-03-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Italian sunglass maker De Rigo SpA said Tuesday that its fiscal 1996 net income was $33.3 million on net sales of $168.8 million, resulting in earnings of $0.75 per ADS.</p>
<p>The company said its 1995 earnings were $1.04 per ADS.</p>
<p>The number of shares used in 1996 calculations was 44.5 million, compared with 40.9 million used in 1995. The exchange rate used in 1996 was $1 per 1,543.10 lira, compared with $1 per 1,629.17 lira in 1995, the company said.</p>
<p>De Rigo 1996 net income was 51.4 billion lira on net sales of 260.4 billion lira.  Its 1995 net income was 69.2 billion lira.</p>
</text>
